<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #333;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-logo {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .sub-header {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .important-note {
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    background-color: #f9f9f9;
  }
  .form-container {
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .form-group {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .form-group label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .form-group input[type="text"], .form-group input[type="email"], .form-group input[type="password"] {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 8px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
  .button {
    padding: 10px 20px;
    background-color: #0056b3;
    color: white;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <div class="header-logo">CLEMSON</div>
      <div class="sub-header">College of BEHAVIORAL, SOCIAL AND HEALTH SCIENCES</div>
      <h1 style="margin-top: 30px;">Creating a new CBSHS Qualtrics Account</h1>
      <div style="font-size: 80px; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">Q</div>
      <p style="margin-top: 40px;">Go to <a href="https://clemsonhealth.qualtrics.com" style="color: #0056b3;">https://clemsonhealth.qualtrics.com</a></p>
      <p>Click on <span style="font-weight: bold;">create an account</span> link</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 40%; float: right;">
      <div class="important-note">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">IMPORTANT NOTE:</h3>
        <p>Accounts may only be created by faculty, staff and students in the College of Behavioral, Social and Health Sciences at Clemson University.</p>
        <p>If you are a student signing up for an account, you will have access until you graduate. It will be your responsibility before graduation to download any surveys that you have created and data that you have collected.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="clear: both;"></div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <p>Use your Clemson email address (<span data-field="email_domain">{{ email_domain }}</span>), not your <span data-field="email_domain">{{ email_domain }}</span> account, to create your account. Enter a password of your choice. When you have finished, click on the <span style="font-weight: bold;">Get Started</span> button.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: center;">
      <div class="form-container">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <div class="header-logo" style="font-size: 24px;">CLEMSON</div>
          <div class="sub-header" style="font-size: 14px;">College of BEHAVIORAL, SOCIAL AND HEALTH SCIENCES</div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Email / Username</label>
          <input type="text" value="{{ email_placeholder }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Password</label>
          <input type="password" value="{{ password_placeholder }}">
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <a href="#" style="font-size: 12px;">Forgot your password?</a>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <button class="button">Sign In</button>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
          <p style="font-size: 12px;"><img src="google_icon.png" alt="Google" style="vertical-align: middle;"> Sign in with Google</p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
          <p style="font-size: 12px;">Please click here to create an account</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="clear: both;"></div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div class="header-logo" style="font-size: 24px;">CLEMSON</div>
    <div class="sub-header" style="font-size: 14px;">College of BEHAVIORAL, SOCIAL AND HEALTH SCIENCES</div>
    <div class="form-container" style="max-width: 400px;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Email Address (This will be your user name)</label>
        <input type="text" value="{{ email_input }}">
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Password</label>
        <input type="password" value="{{ password_input }}">
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Re-Type Password</label>
        <input type="password" value="{{ retype_password_input }}">
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <button class="button">Get Started</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 20px;">These fields are optional, but recommended.</h2>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="form-container">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>First Name (Optional)</label>
          <input type="text" value="{{ first_name_input }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Last Name (Optional)</label>
          <input type="text" value="{{ last_name_input }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Phone Number (Optional)</label>
          <input type="text" value="{{ phone_number_input }}">
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
          <button class="button">Finish</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: center;">
      <!-- Placeholder for visual alignment -->
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="clear: both; margin-top: 50px;"></div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 20px;">No Access Code required.</h2>
    <p>Simply click on the <span style="font-weight: bold;">Sign Me Up</span> button.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div class="form-container" style="width: 350px; text-align: center;">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div class="header-logo" style="font-size: 24px;">CLEMSON</div>
        <div class="sub-header" style="font-size: 14px;">College of BEHAVIORAL, SOCIAL AND HEALTH SCIENCES</div>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <button class="button" style="width: 150px; margin-right: 10px;">Sign Me Up</button>
        <span style="margin-top: 10px;">or</span>
        <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 15px;">
          <label>I Have An Access Code</label>
          <input type="text" value="{{ access_code_input }}" style="width: 100px; display: inline-block;">
          <button class="button" style="width: 80px; display: inline-block; margin-left: 5px;">Go</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="clear: both; margin-top: 50px;"></div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>You will receive an email from Qualtrics; follow the instructions to verify your account.</p>
    <p>After verifying your account, you will always log in at: <a href="https://clemsonhealth.qualtrics.com" style="color: #0056b3;">https://clemsonhealth.qualtrics.com</a></p>
    <p>Questions? Contact: <span data-field="contact_name">{{ contact_name }}</span> | <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span> | <span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 50px; right: 60px; font-size: 12px; text-align: right;">
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">The Learning Resource Center</div>
    <p>Connect. Collaborate. Create.</p>
    <p>Updated: <span data-field="last_updated_date">{{ last_updated_date }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>